 "description": "ExportAbSweep drives both export doors directly, so with gyro\nstabilization paused its \"stab\" and \"grade-stab\" cases would run a warp\nthe real export no longer applies. They are now skipped before either\ndoor renders: pausedSkip(case, gyroAllowed) decides, pausedLine logs\n\"export-ab <id> frame=<n> SKIPPED (gyro paused)\", and the skip is\ncounted in the summary's skipped total. A skipped case never reaches\nthe stats, so it can never be flagged EXPORT_MISMATCH. The neutral and\ngrade cases run as before; with the flag on all four cases run again.\nTests: paused cases are exactly stab and grade-stab, flag-on skips\nnothing, the shipped default is paused, the line carries no flag.",
 "added": [],
 "removed": [],
 "changed": [
  "feat: pause gyro stabilization behind a flag",
  "feat: add project.json migration chain",
  "feat: extend codec probe to dv, av1, apv",
  "fix: gate hlg on api 35 and open an api 34 path",
  "fix: move hdr10 gate from api 29 to api 33",
  "fix: skip stab cases in export a/b while paused"
 ],
